<title>USA: Glenborough Realty Trust raises payout.</title>
<headline>Glenborough Realty Trust raises payout.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MATEO, CALIF. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glenborough Realty Trust Inc Thursday said its board of directors increased the company's quarterly common dividend to $0.32 a share.</p>
<p>In a statement, Glenborough said the increase represents an annualized dividend of $1.28 a share, up 6.7 percent over the rate paid in 1996.</p>
